{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00387",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.58,
      "end_seconds": 2.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Hello there. Please, sit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.03,
      "end_seconds": 3.73,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.29,
      "end_seconds": 7.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Lovely day outside, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.66,
      "end_seconds": 11.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "It is, I almost forgot I was coming here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.51,
      "end_seconds": 14.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "What seems to be the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 15.84,
      "end_seconds": 20.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.82,
      "text": "It's a weak urine stream. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.77,
      "end_seconds": 23.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "And when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.67,
      "end_seconds": 26.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Probably about three months. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.53,
      "end_seconds": 30.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "On a normal day, how strong is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.08,
      "end_seconds": 32.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.07,
      "end_seconds": 35.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.55,
      "end_seconds": 47.57,
      "duration_seconds": 11.02,
      "text": "A feeling that the bladder doesn't empty goes along with it, most of the time. The feeling that the bladder doesn't empty? That's been for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.46,
      "end_seconds": 51.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Okay, I'll just check what's already recorded here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.86,
      "end_seconds": 52.63,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "Please do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.54,
      "end_seconds": 66.07,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Alright, I've got it. Any back pain or weight loss at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.08,
      "end_seconds": 70.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "I haven't had back pain or weight loss, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 71.66,
      "end_seconds": 75.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 76.73,
      "end_seconds": 88.77,
      "duration_seconds": 12.04,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.09,
      "end_seconds": 91.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.0,
      "text": "Any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.49,
      "end_seconds": 92.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Nothing, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.05,
      "end_seconds": 95.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "I'm just saving what we've covered so far."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.77,
      "end_seconds": 113.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Alright, back to you. Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.57,
      "end_seconds": 118.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.06,
      "end_seconds": 131.52,
      "duration_seconds": 12.46,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.03,
      "end_seconds": 133.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 134.8,
      "end_seconds": 138.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.25,
      "end_seconds": 142.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "No, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.72,
      "end_seconds": 147.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.38,
      "end_seconds": 148.15,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.02,
      "end_seconds": 161.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.35,
      "end_seconds": 169.73,
      "duration_seconds": 7.38,
      "text": "An enlarged prostate, for about a year. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.14,
      "end_seconds": 180.05,
      "duration_seconds": 9.91,
      "text": "Go on. Yes, I can see the an enlarged prostate in your file as well. Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.5,
      "end_seconds": 184.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.98,
      "end_seconds": 188.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.01,
      "end_seconds": 191.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.45,
      "end_seconds": 195.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "Let me know if I'm going too fast."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.02,
      "end_seconds": 197.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "No, you're fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.91,
      "end_seconds": 209.02,
      "duration_seconds": 11.11,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. It fits best with an enlarged prostate causing urinary symptoms. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.96,
      "end_seconds": 212.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Oh, is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.23,
      "end_seconds": 228.73,
      "duration_seconds": 15.5,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now an enlarged prostate causing urinary symptoms is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a weak urine stream for about three months, moderate, and no back pain or weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.12,
      "end_seconds": 230.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.91,
      "end_seconds": 234.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "So, I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.82,
      "end_seconds": 237.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.45,
      "end_seconds": 246.31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.86,
      "text": "We should do an ultrasound of the bladder and prostate for urinary symptoms. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.25,
      "end_seconds": 248.09,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.23,
      "end_seconds": 275.63,
      "duration_seconds": 26.4,
      "text": "Let's use tamsulosin, 0.4 milligrams, at night, for four weeks. It's for urinary symptoms. Cut back on tea and coffee after the afternoon and go before you sleep. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. If the symptoms get worse, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Let's review you in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.07,
      "end_seconds": 278.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "Okay, I'll book that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.17,
      "end_seconds": 285.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Tell me what you've taken from all that, so I can fill in any gaps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 286.26,
      "end_seconds": 293.49,
      "duration_seconds": 7.23,
      "text": "So, I take the tamsulosin, 0.4 milligrams, at night and come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.98,
      "end_seconds": 298.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.59,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.96,
      "end_seconds": 301.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "I appreciate your time, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.73,
      "end_seconds": 302.53,
      "duration_seconds": 0.8,
      "text": "Alright, goodbye."
    }
  ]
}